Vendored JavaScript (shipped in the pgokf-web companion, not a Cargo crate)
================================================================================

These two files are served by `pgokf-web` from its own origin and are part of
every companions image and .deb. They are not Cargo dependencies, so
`cargo about` does not see them; their licence texts are vendored beside them
in `crates/pgokf-web/static/vendor/` and reproduced here.

  - htmx 2.x (0BSD)          crates/pgokf-web/static/vendor/htmx.min.js
                             https://github.com/bigskysoftware/htmx
  - 3d-force-graph 1.80.0    crates/pgokf-web/static/vendor/3d-force-graph.min.js
    (MIT)                    https://github.com/vasturiano/3d-force-graph

`3d-force-graph.min.js` is a bundle: it embeds three.js and the other
libraries its own package depends on, each under its own permissive licence.
See the upstream project for that inventory.

